<title>USA: Young Minds files for IPO.</title>
<headline>Young Minds files for IPO.</headline>
<dateline>REDLANDS, Calif 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Young Minds Inc said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) for an initial public offering of 1,100,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Of the 1,100,000 shares being offered to the public, 725,000 shares are being offered by Young Minds Inc and 375,000 shares by certain selling shareholders of the company.</p>
<p>The offering is being managed by an underwriting group led by Sharpe Capital Inc. and Meridian Capital Group Inc.</p>
